The `WeatherForecastingService` class implements the `WeatherDataProvider` interface and is responsible for retrieving historical weather data from multiple providers and aggregating the results. It also subscribes to real-time weather feeds using WebSocket.

The `InMemoryCacheService` class implements the `CacheService` interface and provides an in-memory cache for storing weather data.

The `WebSocketService` class implements the `WebSocketProvider` interface and is responsible for sending real-time weather data to subscribed clients using WebSocket.']

